          "quote": "Ingots of Ti30Hf20Nb20Ta10V10Mo7W3 and Ti38V15Nb23Hf24 RHEAs were prepared using vacuum arc melting with the mixture of high-purify (≥ 99.95 wt%) metals. The raw materials with nominal compositions were melted in a water-cooled copper crucible under the protection of Ti-gettered high-purity argon atmosphere. Ascribing to the high melting point of constituent metals, each ingot was flipped and re-melted at least eight times so as to achieve the chemical homogeneity.",
